*   **No overlay in screen share:**
    *   When user shares “This Tab”, remote viewers never see the overlay (because we capture only the main app element via Element/Region Capture). [\[developer.chrome.com\]](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/web-platform/region-capture/), [\[geeksforgeeks.org\]](https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/css/how-to-hide-elements-in-responsive-layout-using-css/)
